        "text_9dP9xh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>1. Collection – End-of-life clean uniforms and footwear are gathered - <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact Us\">Contact us</a> for collection/drop off details.  <br/>2. Processing – Materials are sorted, stripped of trims, and recycled into raw resources.<br/>3. Reuse – New textiles, insulation, and other sustainable products are created.<br/>4. Reporting – Businesses receive data showing how much waste has been diverted from landfill.</p>"
